# Shared values of target vsphere-lab in environment lab.
# Created by platformctl bootstrap-config. Keys: GOVC_*, TARGET_* and
# DISPOSABLE_* only.
# Only comments, blank lines and KEY=value lines with a literal value are
# allowed: unquoted without spaces, shell characters or ~, 'single quoted',
# or "double quoted" without $ ` \ or ". To set a key, write its value after
# the = and remove the leading "# ". See the platform-catalog
# provision-shared-root-standard.md.

# GOVC_URL (required): vCenter SDK URL of the target
# Example: https://vcenter.example.test/sdk
# GOVC_URL=

# TARGET_FOLDER (required): VM folder of the service hosts
# TARGET_FOLDER=

# TARGET_DATASTORE (optional): Datastore of the service hosts
# TARGET_DATASTORE=
